<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hannaford cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hannaford cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said Friday it cut its rating for Hannaford Bros Co to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the food retailer opened down 3/8 to 33-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
